l time may be needed to conduct research and provide the best resolution</li>\n                  <li>You'll receive a personalized response from our support specialist</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Reference info -->\n              <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #58A1FF, #9D95EB);border-radius:4px;padding:15px;margin:25px 0;text-align:center;\">\n                <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#ffffff;\">\n                  <strong>Reference ID:</strong> {{ $json.body.userid }}\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;color:#444;\">\n                In the meantime, you can try asking <strong>Lance AI</strong>, our AI-powered chatbot, for immediate assistance with common questions. Simply log in to your Freelance Prime dashboard to access Lance.\n              </p>\n\n              <hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid #eef2f7;margin:25px 0;\">\n\n              <!-- Support info -->\n              <div style=\"background:#f9f9fb;border-radius:4px;padding:15px;margin:20px 0;\">\n                <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;color:#0E1A43;font-weight:bold;\">\n                  <span style=\"color:#F966B8;\">⚠️</span> Need Immediate Assistance?\n                </p>\n                <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#666;\">\n                  If your issue is urgent, please reply to this email with <strong>\"URGENT\"</strong> in the subject line, and we'll prioritize your request.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:25px 40px;background:#0E1A43;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#ffffff;\">\n              <div>Freelance Prime - Empowering freelancers worldwide</div>\n              <div style=\"margin-top:8px;\">© 2025 Freelance Prime. All rights reserved.</div>\n            </td>\n          